{"id":"n71273-4-7","stage":1,"title":"빠지다 · 陷入","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71273-4-7-1","ko":"환자의 상태는 어떤가요?","zh":"病人的状况怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"환자의","meaning":"患者，病人","explanation":"환자：患者，病人；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"환자","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31669","senseId":"1","lemma":"환자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"환자의","audio":"/audio/3206658c3d3d56380391.mp3"}},{"text":"상태는","meaning":"状态","explanation":"상태：状态；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"상태","audio":"/audio/e10195a1239fb321327b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16489","senseId":"1","lemma":"상태","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상태는","audio":"/audio/7ad42feccbe84701157f.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤가요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤가요","audio":"/audio/23fa3a0906f95e00f157.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7780fb9b6e0ea5fd","term":"환자","zh":"患者，病人","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3","entryId":"31669","definition":"由于身体生病或受伤而疼痛的人。","pronunciation":["환ː자"]},{"id":"e10195a1239fb321","term":"상태","zh":"状态","audio":"/audio/e10195a1239fb321327b.mp3","entryId":"16489","definition":"事物或现象的模样或情况。","pronunciation":["상태"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d9ac2f9d3dec6d3bc8e2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71273-4-7-2","ko":"벌써 삼 일째 혼수상태에 빠져서 이렇게 누워만 있어요.","zh":"他已经处于昏迷状态三天了，一直就这样躺着。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":